<!-- About Hero Section -->
<section class="hero" style="min-height: 60vh;">
  <div class="apple-container" style="padding: 60px 20px;">
    <h1 class="apple-headline" style="margin-bottom: 24px;">
      Born from necessity.
    </h1>
    <p class="apple-subheadline" style="margin-bottom: 0;">
      The story behind PickPod
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Story Section -->
<section class="apple-section" style="background: white;">
  <div class="apple-container">
    <div style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
      <p class="apple-body" style="margin-bottom: 32px; font-size: 21px; line-height: 1.8;">
        PickPod was created by Salim Khan after discovering a common yet overlooked challenge: the only time available for flossing was during his commute.
      </p>
      <p class="apple-body" style="margin-bottom: 32px; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--apple-gray);">
        After months of dealing with cluttered cup holders filled with used floss picks, he recognized an opportunity for innovation. What started as a personal frustration became a mission to help busy professionals maintain their dental health without compromise.
      </p>
      <p class="apple-body" style="font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--apple-gray);">
        The result is PickPod—a thoughtfully designed solution for individuals who prioritize dental health but lack traditional flossing time. With dedicated compartments for fresh and used picks, PickPod brings organization and convenience to on-the-go oral care, ensuring you never have to choose between your schedule and your dentist's recommendations.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Mission Section -->
<section class="apple-section" style="background: var(--apple-gray-light);">
  <div class="apple-container">
    <div style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center;">
      <h2 class="apple-headline" style="font-size: 40px; margin-bottom: 32px;">
        Our Mission
      </h2>
      <p class="apple-body" style="font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--apple-gray);">
        To make dental hygiene accessible and convenient for everyone, regardless of how busy life gets. Because maintaining a healthy smile shouldn't require sacrificing your daily routine.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

